The statistical analyses were performed using
multivariate analysis of variance (MANOVA) with
multivariate F-value (Wilks’ lambda). A MANOVA
was applied to identify the effect of treatments
and growing period and their interactions as independent variables, and contents of Cd, yield of
biomass, free AAs and FAs as dependent variables.
A MANOVA was followed by the post-hoc comparison Tukey’s test (P < 0.05). All analyses were
performed with Statistica 12.0 software (StatSoft,
Tulsa, USA).

